    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d220">

                <pb facs="0438" n="334" sameAs="frus:frus1933v02/pg334"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.4016/116: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Germany (Gordon) to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-03-26T15:00:00+01:00">March 26, 1933—3
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received March 26—12:15 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>49. My 47, March 25, 3 p.m. I spoke with several chiefs of mission last night who
                    took occasion to express their opinion that outside intercession under the
                    present circumstances would be very unwise.</p>
                <p>Jewish owned <hi rendition="#italic">Berliner Tageblatt</hi> has lined up with
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Frankfurter Zeitung</hi> in attitude reported in my
                    telegram under reference.</p>
                <p>Probably needless to say but I trust the allusion in yesterday’s telegram to
                    forthcoming interview of leading industrialist with Hitler will be treated in
                    the strictest confidence.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gordon</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
